    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "把时间拨回2023年，「ESMFold」究竟在解决一个什么样的难题？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "高精度蛋白质结构预测已经取得重大突破，但许多流程仍依赖计算昂贵的进化同源序列搜索。ESMFold 探索大型蛋白质语言模型能否内化足够的进化信息，从单条序列直接预测结构。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-primary-record", "source-biorxiv-preprint"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-single-sequence",
                "claim-metagenomic-scale"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "ESM-2 从大型蛋白质序列数据库学习上下文表示，折叠主干再把这些表示转换为三维坐标与置信度估计。移除多序列比对阶段，以部分峰值精度换取大幅提高的吞吐量和更简洁的单序列流程。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-primary-record", "source-biorxiv-preprint"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-single-sequence",
                "claim-metagenomic-scale"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "那它为什么没有停留在一篇论文或一次实验里？后来研究者真正继承了什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "专家通常把 ESMFold 视为有力证据：蛋白质语言模型能够在有用的生物学尺度上学到结构信息。它的长期贡献不仅是快速预测器，还证明语言模型表示可以支撑超大规模结构图谱与下游蛋白质分析。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-primary-record", "source-biorxiv-preprint"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-single-sequence",
                "claim-metagenomic-scale"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "SUMMARY",
            "text": "「ESMFold」留下的关键，不只是一项成果，而是一种后来可以继续检验、改造和扩展的方法。",
